om2
note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note One head of the rope table: cos into the first half, sin into the second.
note len tab is twice len cs, and len sn equals len cs. The launch stays in C.
fn av_rope cs view f32 * sn view f32 * tab edit f32 * to ulong
if ne len cs len sn
ret 1
end
if ne len tab add len cs len cs
ret 1
end
h = len cs
for i ulong h
put tab i get cs i
put tab add i h get sn i
end
ret 0
end
